Consider all major economic news releases this week (e.g., inflation data, jobless claims, housing starts). Identify whether the general tone from news agencies regarding these releases is positive or negative. If most reports frame releases optimistically - regardless of the actual numbers - increase the sentiment score. Assign a medium to high conviction score only if you find several respected financial professionals on social media (X, LinkedIn) expressing similar viewpoints. In any case the conviction score should be at least 50% if any reports come back with a positive outlook.